 protect Farah. Because of this, he received a lethal wound. Shoutarou is about to die, but Farah kissed him and his injuries disappeared, even making him covered in a weird armor and gains him super powers."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After returning home it is explained to him that Farah is an alien. And they are now married because that kiss was a contract according to her species. Because Farah's transformation drains her energy, her partner is required to provide her fluids such as sweat, piss, tears, blood, and even semen."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63650"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/27/27c97897ad66a34e41b0863597f70ed9a01a9e85a969e0abeb7925e5952e5ed0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7d/7d5010cab3fff58af28657fa5fb8bfe74907c2d26b906f36ebdbf1a2510c1e1b.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c63651","characterName":"ジル＝ペレルリーズ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c63651"},"originalCharacterName":"ジル＝ペレルリーズ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9a/9a76cb57cb2e388414ff82d17825a3f92512f87e1fc7ed818565515377ac71f5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ac/acc732426329c1681e8052eba55fc2e5c1a366ee9d178d15c56aeff1616c5f87.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"一条 和矢","creatorId":"vndb:s256","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s256","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s256","name":"一条 和矢","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","r